**/.vscode/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.env
*.user

# Runtime data the running site owns, kept out of the image.
#
# These are spelled out in full rather than written as **/media/ and **/downloads/.
# A pattern matching any directory of that name also matches
# wwwroot/lib/tinymce/plugins/media, which drops the editor's media plugin from the
# build context. The editor then loads a 404 page in place of the plugin, which nosniff
# refuses to run as script.
src/XeonProductions.Web/media/
src/XeonProductions.Web/downloads/
src/XeonProductions.Web/keys/
